# Squall Shelf (CIPlay squall_shelf): the tent, the stranded note, the bear, the tent cache (the net), the llama, the
# weather log.
island Squall Shelf
# RESIZE 10-24: the recipe moved this island's old content by 0 -17.6; the points below are in the old frame
offset 0 17.6
expect step 0
expect title The Stranded Tent
zone tent
expect step 1
read Stranded note
expect step 2
kill Polar bear
expect step 3
open Tent cache
wait 3
expect step 4
catch Llama 1
expect step 5
# DEEP 10-24: the weather mast on the hill
zone mast_top
expect step 6
read Weather log
expect done
# the extras: the mast chest, the ice cave, the dark hatch (its lantern), the shuttle to the ledge (3 bolts), treasures
open Weather mast chest
zone ice_cave
read Initials in the ice
open Ice cave chest
open Driver's box
use dhatch
expect shown dhatchlamp
open Under the hatch
use shuttle
wait 12
open Ledge cache
dig 0
dig 1
